<t id="465" p="356.00 427.00" BoundingBox="278.16 419.84 433.84 429.00" Justification="Center" InterpretChemically="no"><s font="3" size="10" color="3" face="0">(hexamethylene diisocyanate)</s></t>
<t id="467" p="280.00 466.00" BoundingBox="280.00 458.84 461.78 468.00" Justification="Left" InterpretChemically="no"><s font="3" size="10" color="3" face="0">NCO : OH = 200 : 3 (ca. 67 : 1)</s></t>
<t id="468" p="280.00 477.00" BoundingBox="280.00 469.84 513.50 479.00" Justification="Left" InterpretChemically="no"><s font="3" size="10" color="3" face="0">each OH capped by one HDI (urethane bond)</s></t>
<t id="469" p="280.00 488.00" BoundingBox="280.00 480.84 465.14 490.00" Justification="Left" InterpretChemically="no"><s font="3" size="10" color="3" face="0">excess HDI removed after reaction</s></t>
<t id="579" p="326.72 549.73" BoundingBox="326.72 542.57 332.28 551.73" Justification="Left" InterpretChemically="no"><s font="3" size="10" color="3" face="2">n</s></t>
<t id="587" p="326.72 581.87" BoundingBox="326.72 574.71 332.28 583.87" Justification="Left" InterpretChemically="no"><s font="3" size="10" color="3" face="2">n</s></t>
<t id="595" p="222.92 562.20" BoundingBox="222.92 555.04 228.48 564.20" Justification="Left" InterpretChemically="no"><s font="3" size="10" color="3" face="2">n</s></t>
<t id="596" p="270.00 615.00" BoundingBox="140.19 607.84 399.81 617.00" Justification="Center" InterpretChemically="no"><s font="3" size="10" color="3" face="1">3-arm NCO-terminated prepolymer, GE-EO-(HDI)</s><s font="3" size="10" color="3" face="33">3</s></t>
<t id="597" p="270.00 626.00" BoundingBox="203.29 618.84 336.71 628.00" Justification="Center" InterpretChemically="no"><s font="3" size="10" color="3" face="0">NCO functionality </s><s font="3" size="10" color="3" face="2">f</s><s font="3" size="10" color="3" face="0"> = 3</s></t>
<t id="598" p="0.00 650.00" BoundingBox="0.00 643.56 442.35 652.00" Justification="Left" InterpretChemically="no"><s font="3" size="9" color="3" face="2">n</s><s font="3" size="9" color="3" face="0"> = average number of EO units per arm (set by the commercial grade / M</s><s font="3" size="9" color="3" face="32">n</s><s font="3" size="9" color="3" face="0"> of the polyol).</s></t>
<t id="599" p="0.00 661.00" BoundingBox="0.00 654.56 452.79 663.00" Justification="Left" InterpretChemically="no"><s font="3" size="9" color="3" face="0">100 equiv. HDI per polyol molecule. </s><s font="3" size="9" color="4" face="1">Blue</s><s font="3" size="9" color="3" face="0"> = HDI-derived end group -C(=O)NH-(CH</s><s font="3" size="9" color="3" face="32">2</s><s font="3" size="9" color="3" face="0">)</s><s font="3" size="9" color="3" face="32">6</s><s font="3" size="9" color="3" face="0">-N=C=O;</s></t>
<t id="600" p="0.00 672.00" BoundingBox="0.00 665.56 418.82 674.00" Justification="Left" InterpretChemically="no"><s font="3" size="9" color="3" face="0">the new urethane bond links the terminal EO oxygen of every arm to an HDI carbonyl.</s></t>
<t id="601" p="0.00 683.00" BoundingBox="0.00 676.56 491.87 685.00" Justification="Left" InterpretChemically="no"><s font="3" size="9" color="3" face="0">The large HDI excess strongly suppresses chain extension (one HDI bridging two polyol OH groups);</s></t>
<t id="602" p="0.00 694.00" BoundingBox="0.00 687.56 461.86 696.00" Justification="Left" InterpretChemically="no"><s font="3" size="9" color="3" face="0">unreacted HDI must be removed (e.g. hexane extraction or thin-film distillation) before use.</s></t>
